WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
This is an edited capture of a fresh C0026 run.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.020
The artifact starts three virtual machines.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:13.940
One hosts Caldera, one represents the attacker, and one is the Linux target.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:18.720
After enrollment, Caldera dispatches the target actions.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:23.880
The runtime records five observed occurrences and one simulated occurrence.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.220
No occurrence failed or was blocked.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:31.040
An independent probe checks the target after execution.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:39.920
It verifies that the collected material matches the declared sources and that the chunks reconstruct the archive.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:46.140
Finally, the runner destroys the virtual machines and seals the receipt.

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:50.340
The artifact validator returned exit zero.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:53.380
Check that all three virtual machines are gone.
